"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"1\n \nSS (IB Dis) (Amdt) Regs 2024","tree_line_end":174,"tree_line_start":165},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"Background","tree_line_end":179,"tree_line_start":175},{"depth":2,"role":"L","text":"2.\nThese regulations\n1\n \ncreate a new disregard to allow certain payments from an estate of a \ndeceased infected person to be disregarded. ","tree_line_end":194,"tree_line_start":180},{"depth":3,"role":"LI","text":"2.\nThese regulations\n1\n \ncreate a new disregard to allow certain payments from an estate of a \ndeceased infected person to be disregarded. ","tree_line_end":194,"tree_line_start":181},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":"2.\nThese regulations\n1\n \ncreate a new disregard to allow certain payments from an estate of a \ndeceased infected person to be disregarded. ","tree_line_end":194,"tree_line_start":183},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"1\n \nSS (IB Dis) (Amdt) Regs 2024","tree_line_end":204,"tree_line_start":195},{"depth":2,"role":"L","text":"3.\nThe disregard applies to payments derived from a payment made from an approved blood \nscheme, or the Scottish Infected Blood Support Scheme to the estate of the person for having \nbeen infected. ","tree_line_end":215,"tree_line_start":205},{"depth":3,"role":"LI","text":"3.\nThe disregard applies to payments derived from a payment made from an approved blood \nscheme, or the Scottish Infected Blood Support Scheme to the estate of the person for having \nbeen infected. ","tree_line_end":215,"tree_line_start":206},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":"3.\nThe disregard applies to payments derived from a payment made from an approved blood \nscheme, or the Scottish Infected Blood Support Scheme to the estate of the person for having \nbeen infected. ","tree_line_end":215,"tree_line_start":208},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":219,"tree_line_start":216},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"Capital disregard","tree_line_end":224,"tree_line_start":220},{"depth":2,"role":"L","text":"4.\nThese regulations\n1\n provide that for ","tree_line_end":237,"tree_line_start":225},{"depth":3,"role":"LI","text":"4.\nThese regulations\n1\n provide that for ","tree_line_end":237,"tree_line_start":226},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":"4.\nThese regulations\n1\n provide that for ","tree_line_end":237,"tree_line_start":228},{"depth":2,"role":"L","text":"1.\nIS\n2\n \n2.\nJSA(IB)\n3\n \n3.\nESA(IR)\n4\n \n4.\nSPC\n5\n ","tree_line_end":285,"tree_line_start":238},{"depth":3,"role":"LI","text":"1.\nIS\n2\n ","tree_line_end":250,"tree_line_start":239},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":"1.\nIS\n2\n ","tree_line_end":250,"tree_line_start":241},{"depth":3,"role":"LI","text":"2.\nJSA(IB)\n3\n ","tree_line_end":262,"tree_line_start":251},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":"2.\nJSA(IB)\n3\n ","tree_line_end":262,"tree_line_start":253},{"depth":3,"role":"LI","text":"3.\nESA(IR)\n4\n ","tree_line_end":274,"tree_line_start":263},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":"3.\nESA(IR)\n4\n ","tree_line_end":274,"tree_line_start":265},{"depth":3,"role":"LI","text":"4.\nSPC\n5\n ","tree_line_end":285,"tree_line_start":275},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":"4.\nSPC\n5\n ","tree_line_end":285,"tree_line_start":277},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"any payment out of the estate of a person, which derives from a payment made under or by","tree_line_end":289,"tree_line_start":286},{"depth":2,"role":"L","text":"1.\nan approved blood scheme or \n2.\nthe Scottish Infected Blood Support Scheme ","tree_line_end":306,"tree_line_start":290},{"depth":3,"role":"LI","text":"1.\nan approved blood scheme or ","tree_line_end":298,"tree_line_start":291},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":"1.\nan approved blood scheme or ","tree_line_end":298,"tree_line_start":293},{"depth":3,"role":"LI","text":"2.\nthe Scottish Infected Blood Support Scheme ","tree_line_end":306,"tree_line_start":299},{"depth":5,"role":"P","text":"2.\nthe Scottish Infected Blood Support Scheme ","tree_line_end":306,"tree_line_start":301},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"to the estate of the person as a result of that person having been infected from contaminated blood \nproducts is disregarded indefinitely.","tree_line_end":311,"tree_line_start":307},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"1 \nSS (IB Dis) (Amdt) Regs 2024\n, reg 2; 2 \n \nIS (Gen) Regs 1987, Sch 10, para 22(5A)\n;","tree_line_end":327,"tree_line_start":312},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":" \n3 \nJSA Regs 1996, Sch 8, para 27(5A)\n; 4 \nESA Regs 2008, Sch 9, para 27(5A);","tree_line_end":342,"tree_line_start":328},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"5 \nSPC Regs 2002, Sch 5, para 15(5A)","tree_line_end":351,"tree_line_start":343},{"depth":2,"role":"H5","text":"Example","tree_line_end":356,"tree_line_start":352},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"Stephen is claiming ESA(IR). Stephen receives a payment of £20,000 from the estate of his late uncle. \nThis money was originally paid directly to the estate of Stephen’s uncle from an approved blood scheme \nas a result of being infected from contaminated blood products. As the payment from the estate of \nStephen’s uncle was derived from a payment made under an approved blood scheme, the DM decides \nthat this payment can be disregarded indefinitely.","tree_line_end":364,"tree_line_start":357},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"Annotations","tree_line_end":369,"tree_line_start":365},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"Please annotate the number of this memo (08-24) against the following DMG paragraphs: \n29446\n, \n52447\n, \n84475","tree_line_end":387,"tree_line_start":370},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":391,"tree_line_start":388},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"Contacts","tree_line_end":396,"tree_line_start":392},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"If you have any queries about this memo, please write to Decision Making and Appeals (DMA) Leeds, 3E \nzone E, Quarry House, Leeds. Existing arrangements for such referrals should be followed, as set out in – \nMemo \n4/19\n Requesting case guidance from DMA Leeds for all benefits.","tree_line_end":407,"tree_line_